Heraldry/IconNames.lua is not covered by this license either: it holds labels made
from World of Warcraft's icon file names, as collected by the community listfile at
https://github.com/wowdev/wow-listfile, and player ability spell IDs from WoW Forever's
spell tables, as exported by https://wago.tools. Both are Blizzard Entertainment's.
